§§ `(e)(3) and (e)(4): the contents of the certificate, and the attached certificate`

GIVEN stated IS A BOOLEAN
      each IS A BOOLEAN
      previously IS A BOOLEAN
      nameTitle IS A BOOLEAN
      attached IS A BOOLEAN
      effective IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 204(e)(3) Certificate of validation`
`t204 certificate` stated each previously nameTitle attached effective MEANS
    `s 204(e)(3) Certificate of validation` WITH
        `it sets forth that the corporation has ratified 1 or more defective corporate acts that would have required the filing of a certificate under s 103` IS stated
        `it sets forth that each such defective corporate act has been ratified in accordance with this section` IS each
        `a certificate was previously filed under s 103 in respect of the act and requires a change to give effect to it` IS previously
        `it sets forth the name, title and filing date of the certificate previously filed and of any certificate of correction` IS nameTitle
        `it sets forth that a certificate containing all the information required is attached as an exhibit` IS attached
        `it sets forth the date and time the certificate shall be deemed to have become effective` IS effective

-- arguments: a. b. previously-filed c.1.A c.B c.C
-- c.1 (a certificate was previously filed and needs a change): name, title, filing date; attachment; effective date and time
#ASSERT `s 204(e)(3) the certificate of validation sets forth what the paragraph requires` (`t204 certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(e)(3) the certificate of validation sets forth what the paragraph requires` (`t204 certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE))
-- c.2 (none was previously filed): the attachment statement and the effective date and time
#ASSERT `s 204(e)(3) the certificate of validation sets forth what the paragraph requires` (`t204 certificate` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(e)(3) the certificate of validation sets forth what the paragraph requires` (`t204 certificate` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(e)(3) the certificate of validation sets forth what the paragraph requires` (`t204 certificate` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(e)(3) the certificate of validation sets forth what the paragraph requires` (`t204 certificate` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(e)(3) the certificate of validation sets forth what the paragraph requires` (`t204 certificate` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE))
-- (e)(4)
#ASSERT `s 204(e)(4) the attached certificate must be separately executed and acknowledged or carry the statement of approval and adoption` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 204(e)(4) the attached certificate must be separately executed and acknowledged or carry the statement of approval and adoption` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `(f): from and after the validation effective time`

-- the validation effective time is 10 March 2026
#ASSERT `s 204(f)(1) the ratified act is no longer deemed void or voidable as a result of the failure of authorization described in the resolutions` TRUE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 3 11) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 204(f)(1) the ratified act is no longer deemed void or voidable as a result of the failure of authorization described in the resolutions` TRUE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 3 9) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 204(f)(1) the ratified act is no longer deemed void or voidable as a result of the failure of authorization described in the resolutions` TRUE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10) EQUALS NOTHING
-- unless the Court of Chancery has determined otherwise in an action under s 205
#ASSERT `s 204(f)(1) the ratified act is no longer deemed void or voidable as a result of the failure of authorization described in the resolutions` TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 3 11) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- an act not ratified in accordance with the section gets nothing from this paragraph
#ASSERT `s 204(f)(1) the ratified act is no longer deemed void or voidable as a result of the failure of authorization described in the resolutions` FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 3 11) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 204(f)(1) the date to which the effect of the ratification is retroactive` (YearMonthDay 2024 7 4) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2024 7 4
#ASSERT `s 204(f)(2) the share of putative stock is no longer deemed void or voidable and is deemed an identical outstanding share` TRUE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 3 11) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 204(f)(2) the share of putative stock is no longer deemed void or voidable and is deemed an identical outstanding share` TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 3 11) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 204(f)(2) the share of putative stock is no longer deemed void or voidable and is deemed an identical outstanding share` FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 3 11) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 204(f)(2) the share of putative stock is no longer deemed void or voidable and is deemed an identical outstanding share` TRUE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 3 9) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 204(f)(2) the date as of which the share is deemed an identical outstanding share` (YearMonthDay 2023 1 15) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2023 1 15

§§ `(g): notice of the board's ratification`

-- src:713: the day established is the day the board adopts the resolutions or a day within 60 days after it
#ASSERT `s 204(g) the day the board establishes is the day the board adopts the resolutions or a day within 60 days after it` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)
#ASSERT `s 204(g) the day the board establishes is the day the board adopts the resolutions or a day within 60 days after it` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 4 30)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(g) the day the board establishes is the day the board adopts the resolutions or a day within 60 days after it` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 5 1))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(g) the day the board establishes is the day the board adopts the resolutions or a day within 60 days after it` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 2 28))

GIVEN current IS A BOOLEAN
      earlier IS A BOOLEAN
      known IS A BOOLEAN
      consent IS A BOOLEAN
      putativeConsent IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 204(g) Holder`
`t204 notice holder` current earlier known consent putativeConsent MEANS
    `s 204(g) Holder` WITH
        `holds valid stock or putative stock, voting or nonvoting, as of the day established for this notice` IS current
        `was a holder of record of valid stock or putative stock as of the time of the defective corporate act` IS earlier
        `the holder's identity and address can be determined from the records of the corporation` IS known
        `the holder approved the action by consent in lieu of a meeting under s 228` IS consent
        `the holder holds putative stock and otherwise consented to the action in writing` IS putativeConsent

-- classes: current holders; holders of record at the time of the act whose identity and address are known
#ASSERT `s 204(g) the holder is within the classes the notice is to be given to` (`t204 notice holder` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 204(g) the holder is within the classes the notice is to be given to` (`t204 notice holder` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(g) the holder is within the classes the notice is to be given to` (`t204 notice holder` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(g) the holder is within the classes the notice is to be given to` (`t204 notice holder` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE))
-- owed: not if notice is to be given under (d); not, where included in a s 228(e) notice, to a stockholder who consented
#ASSERT `s 204(g) the holder is owed this notice` (`t204 notice holder` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(g) the holder is owed this notice` (`t204 notice holder` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(g) the holder is owed this notice` (`t204 notice holder` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE) FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(g) the holder is owed this notice` (`t204 notice holder` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 204(g) the holder is owed this notice` (`t204 notice holder` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE) FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 204(g) the holder is owed this notice` (`t204 notice holder` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(g) the holder is owed this notice` (`t204 notice holder` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) FALSE FALSE)
-- deemed given by a listed corporation's public SEC filing
#ASSERT `s 204(g) the notice required by this subsection and by subsection (d) may be deemed given` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(g) the notice required by this subsection and by subsection (d) may be deemed given` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(g) the notice required by this subsection and by subsection (d) may be deemed given` FALSE TRUE)
-- contents
#ASSERT `s 204(g) the notice contains what the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `s 204(g) the notice contains what the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(g) the notice contains what the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(g) the notice contains what the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- has the corporation done what the subsection requires for this holder?
#ASSERT `s 204(g) the corporation has done what the subsection requires for the holder` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 204(g) the corporation has done what the subsection requires for the holder` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 204(g) the corporation has done what the subsection requires for the holder` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(g) the corporation has done what the subsection requires for the holder` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(g) the corporation has done what the subsection requires for the holder` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(g) the corporation has done what the subsection requires for the holder` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- the deeming sentence
#ASSERT `s 204(g) the notice is treated as notice to a holder of valid stock for the purposes of ss 222, 228, 229, 230, 232 and 233` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 204(g) the notice is treated as notice to a holder of valid stock for the purposes of ss 222, 228, 229, 230, 232 and 233` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 204(g) the notice is treated as notice to a holder of valid stock for the purposes of ss 222, 228, 229, 230, 232 and 233` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `(a) to (f) taken together: has the act been ratified in accordance with the section`

-- arguments: resolutions-ok board-vote-ok abandoned must-submit approved certificate-required certificate-filed
#ASSERT `s 204 the defective corporate act has been ratified in accordance with this section` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 204 the defective corporate act has been ratified in accordance with this section` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE NOTHING FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 204 the defective corporate act has been ratified in accordance with this section` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE NOTHING FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 204 the defective corporate act has been ratified in accordance with this section` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 204 the defective corporate act has been ratified in accordance with this section` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE NOTHING FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 204 the defective corporate act has been ratified in accordance with this section` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 204 the defective corporate act has been ratified in accordance with this section` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE NOTHING FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 204 the defective corporate act has been ratified in accordance with this section` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE NOTHING TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 204 the defective corporate act has been ratified in accordance with this section` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE NOTHING TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE

§§ `(h): the definitions`

-- (h)(1): an overissue; or an election of directors void or voidable for a failure of authorization; or an act within the corporation's power that is void or voidable for a failure of authorization
-- arguments: overissue election purported within-power void-or-voidable
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(1) the act is a defective corporate act` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(1) the act is a defective corporate act` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(1) the act is a defective corporate act` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(h)(1) the act is a defective corporate act` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(h)(1) the act is a defective corporate act` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(h)(1) the act is a defective corporate act` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
-- (h)(2): arguments: title bylaws plan renders-void board-or-officer
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(2) there is a failure of authorization` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(2) there is a failure of authorization` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(2) there is a failure of authorization` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(h)(2) there is a failure of authorization` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(2) there is a failure of authorization` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(h)(2) there is a failure of authorization` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- (h)(3): more shares than the power to issue; or a class not authorized. 101 of 100 is an overissue, 100 of 100 is not.
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(3) the purported issuance is an overissue` 101 100 TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(h)(3) the purported issuance is an overissue` 100 100 TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(3) the purported issuance is an overissue` 10 100 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(h)(3) the purported issuance is an overissue` 10 100 TRUE)
-- (h)(7) and (h)(4)
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(7) the shares are valid stock` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(h)(7) the shares are valid stock` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(h)(7) the shares are valid stock` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(h)(7) the shares are valid stock` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(4) the shares are putative stock` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(4) the shares are putative stock` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(h)(4) the shares are putative stock` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(h)(4) the shares are putative stock` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
-- (h)(5)
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(5) the time of the defective corporate act` (YearMonthDay 2022 9 1) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2022 9 1

§§ `(h)(6): the validation effective time is the latest of three times`

-- no vote required, no certificate, no time specified: the day the board adopts the resolutions (1 March)
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(6) the day of the validation effective time` (`s 204(h)(6)a. the time at which the stockholders approve or the board adopts the resolutions` FALSE NOTHING (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)) (`s 204(h)(6)b. the time the board specified in the resolutions` FALSE NOTHING (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)) (`s 204(h)(6)c. the time the certificate of validation becomes effective` FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)
-- a vote is required and given on 10 March; the board specified 15 March: the later, 15 March
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(6) the day of the validation effective time` (`s 204(h)(6)a. the time at which the stockholders approve or the board adopts the resolutions` TRUE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)) (`s 204(h)(6)b. the time the board specified in the resolutions` FALSE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 15)) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)) (`s 204(h)(6)c. the time the certificate of validation becomes effective` FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 15)
-- the board's time is the adoption day itself: not preceding it, so allowed
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(6) the day of the validation effective time` (`s 204(h)(6)a. the time at which the stockholders approve or the board adopts the resolutions` FALSE NOTHING (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)) (`s 204(h)(6)b. the time the board specified in the resolutions` FALSE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)) (`s 204(h)(6)c. the time the certificate of validation becomes effective` FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)
-- a certificate of validation is required and becomes effective 20 March, after the vote on 10 March: 20 March (paragraph b. is out)
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(6) the day of the validation effective time` (`s 204(h)(6)a. the time at which the stockholders approve or the board adopts the resolutions` TRUE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)) (`s 204(h)(6)b. the time the board specified in the resolutions` TRUE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 25)) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)) (`s 204(h)(6)c. the time the certificate of validation becomes effective` TRUE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 20))) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 20)
-- the certificate is effective before the vote: the vote is the later
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(6) the day of the validation effective time` (`s 204(h)(6)a. the time at which the stockholders approve or the board adopts the resolutions` TRUE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)) (`s 204(h)(6)b. the time the board specified in the resolutions` TRUE NOTHING (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)) (`s 204(h)(6)c. the time the certificate of validation becomes effective` TRUE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 5))) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)
-- the vote is still to come, or the certificate is not yet effective: not determined
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(6) the day of the validation effective time` (`s 204(h)(6)a. the time at which the stockholders approve or the board adopts the resolutions` TRUE NOTHING (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)) (`s 204(h)(6)b. the time the board specified in the resolutions` FALSE NOTHING (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)) (`s 204(h)(6)c. the time the certificate of validation becomes effective` FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(6) the day of the validation effective time` (`s 204(h)(6)a. the time at which the stockholders approve or the board adopts the resolutions` FALSE NOTHING (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)) (`s 204(h)(6)b. the time the board specified in the resolutions` TRUE NOTHING (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)) (`s 204(h)(6)c. the time the certificate of validation becomes effective` TRUE NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- a time specified that precedes the adoption of the resolutions: the text forbids it, so not covered
#ASSERT `s 204(h)(6) the day of the validation effective time` (`s 204(h)(6)a. the time at which the stockholders approve or the board adopts the resolutions` FALSE NOTHING (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)) (`s 204(h)(6)b. the time the board specified in the resolutions` FALSE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 2 28)) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)) (`s 204(h)(6)c. the time the certificate of validation becomes effective` FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `(h) closing sentence: the board's judgment on valid stock and putative stock`

-- no fraud and no determination by the Court: the board's judgment is conclusive
#ASSERT `s 204(h) the status of the shares that the board's judgment makes conclusive` (JUST `shares that are valid stock under s 204(h)(7)`) FALSE NOTHING EQUALS JUST `shares that are valid stock under s 204(h)(7)`
#ASSERT `s 204(h) the status of the shares that the board's judgment makes conclusive` (JUST `shares that are putative stock under s 204(h)(4)`) FALSE NOTHING EQUALS JUST `shares that are putative stock under s 204(h)(4)`
-- actual fraud: not conclusive; the definitions decide
#ASSERT `s 204(h) the status of the shares that the board's judgment makes conclusive` (JUST `shares that are valid stock under s 204(h)(7)`) TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- the Court's determination under s 205 prevails over the board's judgment, fraud or not
#ASSERT `s 204(h) the status of the shares that the board's judgment makes conclusive` (JUST `shares that are valid stock under s 204(h)(7)`) FALSE (JUST `shares that are putative stock under s 204(h)(4)`) EQUALS JUST `shares that are putative stock under s 204(h)(4)`
#ASSERT `s 204(h) the status of the shares that the board's judgment makes conclusive` NOTHING TRUE (JUST `shares that are valid stock under s 204(h)(7)`) EQUALS JUST `shares that are valid stock under s 204(h)(7)`
-- no judgment by the board: nothing for the sentence to make conclusive
#ASSERT `s 204(h) the status of the shares that the board's judgment makes conclusive` NOTHING FALSE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `(i): the means are not exclusive`

#ASSERT `s 204(i) the means is open to the corporation` `ratification under s 204`
#ASSERT `s 204(i) the means is open to the corporation` `validation under s 205`
#ASSERT `s 204(i) the means is open to the corporation` `ratification under common law or otherwise`
#ASSERT `s 204(i) the means is open to the corporation` `adoption or endorsement of an act taken in the name of the corporation before it began to exist`
#ASSERT `s 204(i) the absence or failure of ratification under s 204 or validation under s 205 of itself affects the validity of the act or stock` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- an act not ratified under common law either: (i) says nothing about its validity
#ASSERT `s 204(i) the absence or failure of ratification under s 204 or validation under s 205 of itself affects the validity of the act or stock` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(i) the absence of ratification or validation creates a presumption that the act is a defective corporate act or that the stock is void or voidable` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 204(i) the absence of ratification or validation creates a presumption that the act is a defective corporate act or that the stock is void or voidable` FALSE)
